        dct:description "Provides `--self-test` verifying SHA-256 dataset integrity, RK2 ODE convergence, exact cell area conservation, bitwise determinism (seed=1981), strict 5-regime ordering, and specimen segmentation, achieving 100/100 quick_gate." ;
