        rdfs:label "docs/media/apical_constriction_invagination_growth.gif (generated output)" ;
        dct:description "24-frame animated viscoelastic cell-ring invagination GIF — docs/media/apical_constriction_invagination_growth.gif: rendered output of 1981-odell-apical-constriction-invagination.py at 317bc3c, image/gif, 720087 B, 1386×472 px, 24 frames, artifact_sha256 bae6d14b2d3d772e37c39f45e9e1683e0ce61104b30a716a30a142f3f78d6afb (sha256 bae6d14b2d3d772e37c39f45e9e1683e0ce61104b30a716a30a142f3f78d6afb), spec_fingerprint 1acd5f70fee12f0e5be5421486f55d75d590e4eb46eae0e1702c36d088449766" .
